    "long_instructions": "# Data Architect Challenge\r\n\r\nUse the AI Assistant to diagnose broken data, then write code to fix it.\r\n\r\n1.  **Diagnose with AI:**\r\n    * Copy all the text from `messyData`.\r\n    * Open your AI Assistant and paste the data with this prompt: \"I am designing a database schema. Analyze this JSON data. What inconsistencies do you see in the field names and data types?\"\r\n    * Read the AI's response to understand what you need to fix.\r\n\r\n2.  **Write the Cleaning Loop:**\r\n    * In `script.js`, find `cleanTheData()`.\r\n    * Write a **For Loop** to go through the list.\r\n    * Inside the loop, create a new object that fixes the issues (e.g., use `parseInt()` for Age, ensure all keys are lowercase).\r\n\r\n3.  **Run & Verify:**\r\n    * Click **Run Your Cleaning Loop**.\r\n    * Copy the text from **2. Clean Output**.\r\n\r\n4.  **Final AI Check:**\r\n    * Paste the new data into the AI Assistant with this prompt: \"Here is my cleaned dataset. Is the schema now consistent for all users?\"",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Schema Architect L2</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  <script src=\"script.js\" defer></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <header>\n      <h1>Schema Architect </h1>\n\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"panels\">\n      <div class=\"card error-border\">\n        <div class=\"card-header\">\n          <h2>1. Messy Input</h2>\n          <span class=\"badge error\">5 Issues Detected</span>\n        </div>\n        <textarea id=\"messyInput\" readonly></textarea>\n        <div class=\"action-bar\">\n          <p class=\"instruction\">Step 1: Copy this & ask AI to find errors.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"flow-arrow\">➔</div>\n\n      <div class=\"card success-border\">\n        <div class=\"card-header\">\n          <h2>2. Clean Output</h2>\n          <span class=\"badge success\">AI Ready</span>\n        </div>\n        <textarea id=\"cleanOutput\" readonly>Waiting for script...</textarea>\n        <div class=\"action-bar\">\n          <button id=\"runBtn\" class=\"primary-btn\">Run Cleaning Loop</button>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"instruction-small\">Step 3: Copy result & ask AI to verify.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": ":root {\n  --bg: #eef2f5;\n  --card-bg: #ffffff;\n  --text: #2c3e50;\n  --accent: #8e44ad; /* Changed to Purple for \"Advanced\" feel */\n  --error: #c0392b;\n  --success: #27ae60;\n  --mono: 'Menlo', 'Consolas', monospace;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 20px;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.container { width: 100%; max-width: 950px; }\n\nheader { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 25px; }\n\n.tag {\n  background: #333;\n  color: #fff;\n  padding: 2px 8px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  font-size: 0.6em;\n  vertical-align: middle;\n}\n\n.panels {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: stretch;\n  gap: 15px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card-bg);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 15px;\n  flex: 1;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n}\n\n.error-border { border-top: 4px solid var(--error); }\n.success-border { border-top: 4px solid var(--success); }\n\n.card-header {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\nh2 { font-size: 1rem; margin: 0; }\n\ntextarea {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 350px; /* Taller for more data */\n  background: #f8f9fa;\n  border: 1px solid #ddd;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  padding: 10px;\n  font-family: var(--mono);\n  font-size: 0.8rem; /* Smaller font for complex data */\n  resize: none;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\ntextarea:focus { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); }\n\n.action-bar {\n  margin-top: 15px;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.primary-btn {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: white;\n  border: none;\n  padding: 10px 20px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.2s;\n}\n\n.primary-btn:hover { background: #732d91; }\n\n.instruction { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666; font-style: italic; }\n.instruction-small { font-size: 0.8rem; text-align: center; margin-top: 10px; color: #888; }\n.badge { font-size: 0.7rem; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; color: white; text-transform: uppercase; }\n.badge.error { background: var(--error); }\n.badge.success { background: var(--success); }\n.flow-arrow { font-size: 1.5rem; color: #ccc; align-self: center; }\n\n@media (max-width: 700px) {\n  .panels { flex-direction: column; }\n  .flow-arrow { transform: rotate(90deg); margin: 10px 0; }\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "const messyData = [\n  { \n    Name: \"Alice\", \n    Age: 16, \n    registered: true, \n    clubs: [\"Chess\", \"Math\"] \n  },\n  { \n    name: \"Bob\", \n    age: \"17\", \n    registered: \"yes\", \n    Clubs: \"Robotics\" \n  }, \n  { \n    Name: \"Charlie\", \n    is_registered: 0 \n  },\n  \n  { \n    name: \"Dana\", \n    Age: \"sixteen\", \n    registered: \"no\", \n    clubs: null \n  } \n];\n\n\n// DOM Elements\nconst messyInput = document.querySelector(\"#messyInput\");\nconst cleanOutput = document.querySelector(\"#cleanOutput\");\nconst runBtn = document.querySelector(\"#runBtn\");\n\n\n\n// Display messy data\nmessyInput.value = JSON.stringify(messyData, null, 2);\n\nconst cleanTheData = () => {\n  let cleanedList = [];\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n  return cleanedList;\n};\n\nrunBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n  const result = cleanTheData();\n  cleanOutput.value = JSON.stringify(result, null, 2);\n});",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
